 ago the evidence here fully  supports this both wear capes dressed in  similar colors although it's a bit tough  to make out in the dark and he carries a  blaster but perhaps the most interesting  evidence is this listen carefully as  Boba Fett enters this scene in Empire  Strikes Back now listen to the sound  here in the Mandalorian  [Music]  it's the same exact sound effect now  maybe that could be a coincidence II  might be an entirely new bounty hunter  we haven't met yet  or perhaps Moff gideon but my guess is  that guy wouldn't be out alone in the  desert he'd probably be surrounded by  troops now is fennec dead well I'd say  her character was a distraction for the  bigger Boba Fett reveal but if cloning  is part of this series as dr. Pershing  alluded to earlier on in the season who  knows what could be possible finally  where could we be going next  well according to IMDB Episode six  centers around the Mandalorian joining a  crew of mercenaries on a dangerous  mission now this is likely where we'll  meet bill burrs character and this  Twi'lek you can see the Razr crest at  docked in what appears to be space so  this may be a matter of if he helps them  they'll let him go kind of thing that's  it for this video I hope you'll give it  a like and subscribe I also want to hear  your thoughts and theories about the  show below do you also think it's Boba  Fett you can also follow me on twitter  at think story whitey and until next  time remember I have spoken

